476
00:27:42.919 --> 00:27:44.087
No, no. Wait. Wait, wait.

477
00:27:44.120 --> 00:27:46.456
Destroy all do-gooders.

478
00:27:46.489 --> 00:27:48.624
Yes. Destroy all do-gooders.

479
00:27:48.658 --> 00:27:51.094
Destroy all do-gooders.

480
